{"unit_id":"G57651__dsh-one-click-restart#feature-1","repo":"G57651/dsh-one-click-restart","commit":"920804529f0f32c2fd61095086411a395a6ed87a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"One Click Restart 的功能「侧边栏快速重启」：在侧边栏底部显示重启按钮，点击后通过本机 HTTP 路由安排重启；按钮显示处理中、成功安排或失败状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:159-185","src/client/index.tsx:238-245","src/index.ts:584-609"]}
